menuconfig MODULES_NROS_UORB_BRIDGE
	bool "nros_uorb_bridge"
	default n
	---help---
		nano-ros uORB -> RMW bridge: reads a uORB topic in-firmware (raw PX4
		struct, no decode) and re-publishes it as CDR px4_msgs on a networked
		backend, so a ROS 2 subscriber sees it. Zero-copy is not claimed for
		the outward half.
